<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_document" style="font-size:173%;">Adaptive Capacity Allocation for Vision Language Action Fine-tuning
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
